  "bio": "Sorella Tavares is a highly skilled fineline tattoo artist based in Enskede, Sweden, who specializes in delicate machine linework, dotwork, and poke tattoos. At Narval Studio, clients can expect nothing less than a professionally conducted session, as Sorella's attention to detail ensures each piece is a meticulous work of art. With a portfolio showcasing elegant designs, Sorella's expertise is evident in every tattoo they create.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Enskede, Stockholm County, Sweden\n\nPoke + machine\n✺ @narval.studio ✺\nDM or sorella@post.com\nBasketry: @solkattens.korgverk\nPrivate: @sorla.solkatt",
